{"id":"vod_bf_15102","vodId":"15102","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"假面骑士01","name_cn":"假面骑士01","date":"2019-01-01","year":"2019","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-16/8f8710567aefc073444afa36a594dd75.jpg"},"summary":"这是新时代骑士与人工智能的正面交锋。故事背景设定为迎来新时代的日本。引领人工智能潮流的公司——“飞电智能”，研发了一款AI机器人，并将其投入到实际运用中。它们完美融入了职场，把新时代朝着电子化的方向推进。但妄图灭绝人类的恐怖分子“灭亡迅雷站”黑了机器人的系统使之暴走。在这样的情况下，政府成立了专门针对AI犯罪的人工智能特务机关，来镇压暴走的AI机器人，维持治安。在一系列事件中，以成为搞笑艺人为目标的主角——飞电或人成了中心人物。在被炒鱿鱼的主人公面前出现了一辆无人驾驶的高档车，然后他突然间被告知，自己要继承飞电智能公司社长的宝座……","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-10 03:51:35","playable":true,"episodeCount":46,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiamianqishi01/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiamianqishi01/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiamianqishi01/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiamianqishi01/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiamianqishi01/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiamianqishi01/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiamianqishi01/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiamianqishi01/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiamianqishi01/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiamianqishi01/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiamianqishi01/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiamianqishi01/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiamianqishi01/第13集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiamianqishi01/第14集/index.m3u8"